  "body": "Property Documentation can be downloaded here: \r\nhttps://www.harcourtsfiles.co.nz/listings/JQ48\r\n\r\nWake up to elevated water views, enjoy your morning coffee on the deck, and let the kids and dogs loose in a fully fenced section. This is easy, relaxed Gulf Harbour living with room for everyone.\r\n\r\nSet down a quiet right-of-way, the home feels nicely removed from the road while remaining conveniently close to Gulf Harbour's amenities, schools, golf course, ferry connections and coastal walking tracks. It's a home that offers both space and an easy sense of everyday living.\r\n\r\nInside, the upper level is dedicated to family accommodation, with four genuine bedrooms, including a generous master complete with ensuite. The three remaining bedrooms are all comfortable doubles with built-in wardrobes, while the family bathroom and excellent storage add to the home's practicality.\r\n\r\nThe heart of the home is the open-plan kitchen, dining and living area, where stone benchtops and a functional layout make entertaining and family life effortless. From here, step outside onto the generous deck and take in the outlook. The elevated position delivers sweeping views across Gulf Harbour, towards the marina, over the waters of the Waitemata Harbour and towards Shakespeare Regional Park. It's a beautiful backdrop to morning coffee, summer evenings and relaxed entertaining with friends.\r\n\r\nOutside, the fully fenced and dog-proof section provides plenty of space for children and pets, with established gardens and mature citrus trees adding to the sense of home. An internal-access double garage, carpeted throughout and complemented by central vacuum, provides the practical finishing touches.\r\n\r\nIf you're looking for more room for the family, a private home with a beautiful outlook and a relaxed coastal lifestyle, this is one you'll want to see for yourself. Available to view by private appointment.",
